\newlabel{fig:workflow}{{3}{7}{System workflow. \emph {Enrollment:} IDE extracts the immutable anchor~$e_0$. \emph {Live monitoring:} per-frame pipeline produces signals fused by RFE. \emph {Session end:} risk trajectory and attribution data forwarded for human review}{figure.3}{}}
